<00:00:00.154>The <00:00:00.197>trip <00:00:00.458>took <00:00:00.784>almost <00:00:01.089>five <00:00:01.295>years. <00:00:02.034>On <00:00:02.110>September <00:00:03.522>1, <00:00:03.836>1979, <00:00:04.621>I <00:00:04.697>reached <00:00:04.980>Saturn. <00:00:05.719>I <00:00:05.795>flew <00:00:06.034>just <00:00:06.263>outside <00:00:06.654>the <00:00:06.730>bright <00:00:07.023>rings <00:00:07.534>and <00:00:07.632>found <00:00:07.871>a <00:00:07.915>thin <00:00:08.219>new <00:00:08.382>one. <00:00:09.023>I <00:00:09.078>was <00:00:09.197>also <00:00:09.426>a <00:00:09.480>scout. <00:00:10.219>Two <00:00:10.349>bigger <00:00:10.589>spacecraft, <00:00:11.458>the <00:00:11.545>Voyagers, <00:00:12.306>were <00:00:12.426>coming <00:00:12.665>behind <00:00:13.002>me, <00:00:13.415>and <00:00:13.513>their <00:00:13.643>team <00:00:14.089>needed <00:00:14.328>to <00:00:14.404>know <00:00:14.719>if <00:00:14.806>flying <00:00:15.165>past <00:00:15.480>the <00:00:15.556>rings <00:00:15.839>was <00:00:15.980>safe. <00:00:16.763>I <00:00:16.828>went <00:00:16.980>through. <00:00:17.567>I <00:00:17.632>was <00:00:17.773>fine. <00:00:18.458>So <00:00:18.545>they <00:00:18.654>knew.
